### Bonus Points Rules API Tests (Admin Only)
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### Variables - Update these with real values
@ruleId = 
@taskTemplateId = 

###
### List All Bonus Rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### List Active Bonus Rules Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules?active=true
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Create Bonus Rule - Consecutive Days
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Dishwasher Streak",
  "description": "Earn 20 bonus points for washing dishes 5 consecutive days",
  "bonusPoints": 20,
  "ruleType": "consecutive_days",
  "ruleConfig": {
    "taskTemplateId": "{{taskTemplateId}}",
    "requiredDays": 5
  }
}

###
### Create Bonus Rule - Monthly Task Count
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Monthly Cleaning Champion",
  "description": "Earn 50 bonus points for completing 20 cleaning tasks in a month",
  "bonusPoints": 50,
  "ruleType": "monthly_task_count",
  "ruleConfig": {
    "taskTemplateId": "{{taskTemplateId}}",
    "requiredCount": 20
  }
}

###
### Get Bonus Rule by ID (replace {ruleId} with actual UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules/{{ruleId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Update Bonus Rule (replace {ruleId} with actual UUID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules/{{ruleId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Updated Rule Name",
  "description": "Updated rule description",
  "bonusPoints": 30
}

###
### Activate Bonus Rule (replace {ruleId} with actual UUID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules/{{ruleId}}/activate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Deactivate Bonus Rule (replace {ruleId} with actual UUID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules/{{ruleId}}/deactivate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Get Bonus Rule - Not Found (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Create Bonus Rule - Invalid Data (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bonus-rules
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Invalid Rule"
}
